### Prueba A6: ver el usuario con sesión activa (esperado 200)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}




### Prueba 1: crear cliente (esperado 201, id 7)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Daniela Cardona",
  "phone": "3008887766",
  "email": "daniela@correo.com"
}

### Prueba 2: crear sin nombre (esperado 400)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/clients
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "phone": "3008887766"
}

### Prueba 3: editar cliente 7 (esperado 200)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/clients/7
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Daniela Cardona Ruiz",
  "phone": "3008887766",
  "email": "daniela@correo.com"
}

### Prueba 4: eliminar cliente 7 (esperado 200)
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/clients/7
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Prueba 5: consultar cliente eliminado (esperado 404)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/clients/7
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}




### Prueba 6: listar servicios con su categoría (esperado 200)
